WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,350 --> 00:00:07,460
I'm laughing so hard. Can I laugh stupidly?

2
00:00:07,460 --> 00:00:08,460
nothing

3
00:00:08,460 --> 00:00:10,460
Just thought of some interesting things

4
00:00:11,460 --> 00:00:21,370
I have a very curious question

5
00:00:21,370 --> 00:00:23,400
It’s you, the student on the combat strength list, who has the most energy

6
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:25,400
Students who are extremely talented are still very energetic.

7
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,490
what do i mean

8
00:00:28,490 --> 00:00:29,490
I'm just thinking

9
00:00:29,490 --> 00:00:31,490
before you make me regret it

10
00:00:31,490 --> 00:00:34,490
Can Lin Ruoyu let you taste regret first?

11
00:00:34,490 --> 00:00:39,780
How can a grown man say such things?

12
00:00:39,780 --> 00:00:40,780
Don't you feel ashamed?

13
00:00:40,780 --> 00:00:42,820
I really don’t know why Lin Ruoyu would like you.

14
00:00:42,820 --> 00:00:44,820
A coward who only hides behind women

15
00:00:44,820 --> 00:00:47,850
Lin Ruoyu is my girlfriend
